WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:06.322
Welcome to SharpStudy, a free place for school students to learn sharp.

2
00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:13.996
Every lesson is taught one clear step at a time, in English or Tamil, by your own friendly teacher.

3
00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:19.534
Start by choosing your class. Then pick a subject and a chapter.

4
00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:25.768
Each chapter is broken into small topics, so you always know what to learn next.

5
00:00:26.018 --> 00:00:31.978
Open a topic and Malar, your teacher, walks you through it step by step.

6
00:00:32.228 --> 00:00:37.660
Tap next when you are ready, and listen along with read aloud if you like.

7
00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:45.934
In the classroom, the board comes alive. The teacher talks while the board draws, writes and turns shapes around.

8
00:00:46.184 --> 00:00:53.224
Now try it yourself. Practice questions give you hints, and tell you straight away if you are right.

9
00:00:53.474 --> 00:00:58.330
Questions you miss come back later, so you really remember them.

10
00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:04.804
Stuck on something? Ask the teacher your doubt, and get a clear answer from the lesson.

11
00:01:05.054 --> 00:01:11.734
Watch your stars and your daily streak grow, and see exactly how you are doing in every chapter.

12
00:01:11.984 --> 00:01:15.808
Switch between English and Tamil any time you like.

13
00:01:16.058 --> 00:01:25.042
Parents get their own page to follow each child's progress. The site can also be private, opened only with an invite code.

14
00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:35.908
Discover something new in GK, practise for exams with Question papers, and read free books in the E-Library. You can use all three today.

15
00:01:36.158 --> 00:01:40.990
That is SharpStudy. Pick a topic and start learning sharp today.

